# Where the mushaf files are: a folder laid out like the repository's data/ (mushaf/, fonts/, audio/).
# Leave it unset during development: the dev server serves ../data at /data.
# Production: your own Worker or domain in front of the R2 bucket, e.g. https://files.example.com/v1
# VITE_FILES_BASE=https://files.example.com/v1

# The reciters' audio, if it is not under VITE_FILES_BASE/audio
# VITE_AUDIO_BASE=https://files.example.com/v1/audio
